Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:28:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2429/3799] soh: rename func_80ADE9BC ->
 EnPoh_SetupTalkComposer

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs the composer brothers' conversation action
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
index 5464a38a1..33aefa2b3 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
@@ -466,7 +466,8 @@ void EnPoh_SetupTalkRegular(EnPoh* this) {
     this->actor.home.pos.y = this->actor.world.pos.y - 15.0f;
 }
 
-void func_80ADE9BC(EnPoh* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80ADE9BC: installs the composer brothers' conversation action
+void EnPoh_SetupTalkComposer(EnPoh* this) {
     this->actionFunc = EnPoh_TalkComposer;
 }
 
@@ -780,7 +781,7 @@ void func_80ADFE80(EnPoh* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
     if (Actor_ProcessTalkRequest(&this->actor, play)) {
         if (this->actor.params >= EN_POH_SHARP) {
-            func_80ADE9BC(this);
+            EnPoh_SetupTalkComposer(this);  // was func_80ADE9BC [LLM:HIGH]
         } else {
             EnPoh_SetupTalkRegular(this);  // was func_80ADE998 [LLM:HIGH]
         }
